  "reference": "Shītwa Sha Batūng'Wa 21",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūgendo lwa kūja Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyashika ī likanza, tūlinhya itanga tūgoloola tūjile tūūkashika Kosi, ū kū ntondo yaho tūshika Lodo, ū kūfuma a henaho tūja Patala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūbona meli ījile Foenike, twingīla ng'wenūmo, tūbūūka tūjile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Kupulo twīloleela dūhū, twītūla kū nkono gwa lūmoso, a bise tūja nalo ū lūgendo tūlolile Sulia; tūūkakola Tulo, nguno ī meli yabbakūūlaga miligo hoi a henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūbona hoi bahemba, twikala nabo shikū mpungatī; būng'hūgūla na kūng'hūgūla ū Paulo mu nguzu ja ng'wa Moyo, gīkī atizūja ī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho jashika ī shikū ja kūbūūka, twandya dūhū ū lūgendo; a bose būtūshindīkīla, pye na a bakīma na a banīgīnī būfuma hamò nise ī hanze ya nzengo; aho twashika a ha ng'walo tūtuja mazwi kūlomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twahayūmala ū kwilaga nabo, twingīla mu meli a bise, nabo būshoka kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūja nalo ū lūgendo lwise ū kūfuma ī Tulo, aho twashika Putolemai tūbagīsha a badūgū, tūlenda nabo hoi lūshikū lūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ntondo yaho tūshika Kaisalia, tūūkikala ha ng'wa Nomeeji Filipo, ūyo walī ūmò wa bagunanhi abo mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na bashīke bane bahangi, baalī batatoolilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho tūkikala ho shikū ningī, kwitulwa washika ng'hangi nebe kūfuma sī ya Būyudaya, lina lyakwe Agaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūshika aho twalī, ūsola ngwasho go ng'wa Paulo, wibohya a magūlū na a makono; hūna ūhaya, “Ū Moyo Ng'wela alīhaya gīkī, ‘A Bayudaya bakūja bakamohye gīkī ū ng'wenekīlī ngwasho ūyū, bantūūle mu makono ga banhū ba mahanga.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a bise, a bageni na a baho na kale, twandya kūng'wikūmbīlīja atizūja ī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Paulo ūshosha ūhaya gīkī, “Bing'we mulīīta mhayo kī ū gwenūyū, mulīlīla gīkī munigwishe ng'holò? Managi gīkī ū nene natazunije kūtungwa dūhū, alīyo nūūlū kūchīla ko ī Yelusalemu, kūlwa lina lya ng'wa Seeba Yesu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho twabona gīkī atīko kūgalūchiwa, tūhaya, “Leka īshikīīle īyo Seeba atogilwe ībize ho; tūhuumūla tūneka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya shikū ndebe, tūgolanya lūgendo lwise; tūbūūka tūjile Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahemba balebe bana Kaisalia biza hamò nise, būtūshikīja ha kaya ya ng'wa Naasoni, gīkī tūlende ha ng'wakwe. Walī ng'hemba wa shikū ningī, fumo yakwe Kupulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo kūja kwibona na Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho twashika ī Yelusalemu, būtwanukūla na būyegi a badūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ntondo yaho tūja nang'hwe ū Paulo kwibona na Yakobo; na a banamhala baalīho pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twahayūmala ū kūbagīsha, ū Paulo wandya kūbonzoolela gūmò gūmò, pyī īyo yalī yabeejiwa na Mulungu kūbītīla mu būtūmami bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bigwa būnkumīlīja Mulungu, būng'wīla ū Paulo gīkī, “Bebe ndūgū wise, ūlībona gīkī a Bayudaya abo baazunije balī mashihūmbī makūmi mingī; na pye a bose balī na būjangīīzu būtaale no ū kū shilagīlo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo hū baamalile kūwīlwa gīkī, ū bebe ūkūjaga ūbawīla a Bayudaya abo balī mu sī ja mahanga, gīkī balekane nang'hwe ū Musa; booye nū kūyūbasaala a baana babo, pyī nū kūshimīzīla ū mu shīmīle shise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī lūūlū, gūlīho mhayo kī ū go kwīta? Nguno bakwigwa dūhū ī gīkī wizile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, leka tūkūwīle gūyū mhayo ūgwīte; balīho banhū bane hamò nise aha balī mu shilahīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basolage wiyeeje hamò nabo, ūbafunīje bebe ī sabo ja kūmoogelwa ī mitwe yabo. Ū mu gīko pye a banhū bakūmana gīkī, ī mihayo īyo bakūwīlagwa kūlwa nguno yako ītī ya ng'hana; bakūbona gīkī ū bebe ūkūshimīzīlaga mo ū mu shilagīlo, na hangī ūshidimile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya banhū ba mahanga ī yene twamala kwizunīlīja kale, tūbandīkīla na kūbandīkīla, gīkī balekane nū būfunya bo shitambo kū mashiikolile, nū kūlya a mininga nūūlū ndimu ja kūbūlagwa na kwitwa mininga yaya; balekane nayo gete ī yenīyo, pyī nū būjingi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a ha ntondo yaho ū Paulo ūbasola a banhū benabo wiyeeja hamò nabo; hūna wingīla mu hekalu kūbasomboolela ī likanza lya kwejiwa kwabo; na gīkī ūlū lyūng'wa, shikūfunyiwa ī shitambo kūlwa būlī ūmò wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūding'wa kwa ng'wa Paulo mu hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jegeela kūshila ī shikū ījo mpungatī, Bayudaya balebe, ba kūfuma Asia, būmona ū Paulo alī mu hekalu. Būng'haja na makono gabo kūnū balīyoganya, bakwitanaga banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balīhaya gīkī, “Bagosha Baisilaeli twangūhīlagi, ū ng'wing'wana ng'wenūyū hū ng'wene ūyo akūjaga hose hose, ūlanga mihayo ya kūlīgomela ī lihanga lise nī shilagīlo; pyī nī lipandī lyenīlī. Nīyo wingījaga na Bayunani ū mu hekalu, kūlīsosohaja ī lipandī lyeela īlī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakahaya gīko īkī baalī bamona ū Paulo ū mu nzengo alī na Tilofimo muna Efeso, biganikaga gīkī walī wingīla hamò nang'hwe nū mu hekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna pyī ū nzengo gūyugūūka ī likanza lyenīlo; bugidinga nhambo a banhū. Būndima ū Paulo, būndutanja bamfunije hanze ya hekalu; haho na haho yūlugalwa ī milyango! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bataalī būhadīkīja kūhaya kūmūlaga, jūshika ī mhola kūlī ntaale wa mabita ga bashilikale, gīkī yayogooka ī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe haho na haho witana bashilikale na bataale babo, būpeela bajile ū kū yombo. A Bayudaya aho bamona ū ntaale wa mabita, hamò na a bashilikale abo walī nabo, boya ū kūntūlagūla ū Paulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntaale wa mabita wegeela ho ūndima, ūlagīla atungwe minyololo ībīlī abūjiwe alī nani, hangī wītaga mhayo kī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bandya kūyoganya ū ng'wibita, abo balīhaya kīngī na a babo nabo balīhaya kīngī. Ū ntaale wa mabita ūduuma ū kwīmana īyo yahayiagwa kūlwa nguno ya yombo, nose ūkalīla kūlagīla dūhū gīkī, ū Paulo akingījiwe mu ng'hambī ya bashilikale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bashilikale aho bashika a ha mita, yūbigeleelwa kūmūcha ū Paulo, ū kūng'wingīja ū mu ng'hambī, nguno ū nsambo gwa banhū gūkongeja ū kūkūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī libita lya banhū abo bakūūbījaga bajaga balīhaya gīkī, “Mūlagagi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsombooji bo ng'wa Paulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Paulo aho wegeela ū kwingījiwa ū mu ng'hambī ya bashilikale, ūng'wīla ū ntaale wa mabita gīkī, “Nadūgije kūkūwīla mhayo?” Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Bebe ūmanile Shiyunani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtī ng'wene ū muna Misili ūyo walī wenhelegije nsambo makanza malebe ū mu shikū ījo jabītile, ūkuminga n'ibita lya banhū babūlagi shihūmbī shine, ūja nabo kū mapoolu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Paulo ūhaya, “Mm yaya, ū nene nalī Nyudaya muna Taso ya Kilikia, nzengo ūyo gūtī gwa kwibengelejiwa; nalīkūlomba ūnizunīlīje nayombe nabo a banhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūnzunīlīja ng'hana. Ū Paulo wīmīīla ha malinhīlo ga kwingīlīla ū mu numba ya ng'hambī, ūbahūngīja nkono a banhū būhuumūlīja sele. Hūna ūbawīla mu lūlīmi lo Shihebulania alīhaya gīkī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
